+// DirectoryPreparation runs once after a directory's source files have been
+// parsed successfully, in deterministic file order, and before imports,
+// declarations, or bodies are inferred. It can prepare the caller's import
+// schema using the freshly parsed declarations without parsing the files again.
+//
+// The files are invocation-local and must only be inspected during this call:
+// do not modify or retain them. Inference subsequently mutates these same ASTs.
+// The callback is also called for an empty directory, but never on a parse or
+// project-config error. An error prevents inference and is returned unchanged.
+// Service cleanup remains owned by the directory evaluation entrypoint.
+type DirectoryPreparation func(context.Context, []*FileBlock) error
+
